{"title":"YELLOW","artist":"카미야마 요우","sourceId":"reference:UKTjlXTyIrEjQfOKcH5O","sourceHash":"48f6f945ed76e214f121f44895dc015850b3f6a4cb526daac01ea6664c670f85","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.45,"end":3.07,"text":"つまりは好奇心に囚われてたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.07,"end":5.06,"text":"大切なものなら壊したんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":5.06,"end":7.05,"text":"明かりの灯がないホールケーキ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":7.05,"end":9.57,"text":"木製の君と踊ってたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":9.57,"end":11.13,"text":"クローゼットで待った今日は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":11.13,"end":13.19,"text":"小さな体ただ寄せ合って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":13.19,"end":14.84,"text":"眠るのさ、変わるのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":14.84,"end":17.15,"text":"想像容易い安全","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":17.15,"end":20.15,"text":"「私馬鹿な子どこにも行かないで」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":21.54,"end":24.54,"text":"重たい正体は鈍い目を覚ませ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":25.48,"end":28.48,"text":"夜のうちが片付けたおもちゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":29.24,"end":32.239999999999995,"text":"無邪気なままでまだいたかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":37.73,"end":40.73,"text":"愛情は HIGH ただ捨て置くばっかり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":42.14,"end":45.14,"text":"測れない落ちた大事な記憶","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":45.81,"end":48.81,"text":"But 後悔 Low-life ならば敢えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":50.28,"end":53.28,"text":"ありえないことを願う夏を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":53.97,"end":56.97,"text":"YELLOW...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":69.63,"end":72.13,"text":"あいつは好奇心に殺されたようだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":72.13,"end":74.22,"text":"狡猾なものなら試したんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":74.22,"end":76.11,"text":"うだつの上がらないあんな行為","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":76.11,"end":78.6,"text":"満面の笑みで歌ってたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":78.6,"end":80.22,"text":"クローゼットで待った今日は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":80.22,"end":82.34,"text":"一人で待つならこんなもんか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":82.34,"end":85.34,"text":"変わるのさ、終わるのさ、肯定","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":85.78,"end":88.46000000000001,"text":"求め續けてる 価値 価値 価値 染まる秒針","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":88.46000000000001,"end":90.32,"text":"もっと巻いて業 深くなって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":90.32,"end":92.63,"text":"終いには天地が 逆さまになる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":92.63,"end":94.68,"text":"なんで？どうして？ほら霞んだ透明","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":94.68,"end":97.68,"text":"「窓から見た景色をまだ覚えています」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":98.99000000000001,"end":101.99000000000001,"text":"いっそ消えて無くなるだけのYELLOW","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":106.81,"end":109.81,"text":"YELLOW...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":122.94,"end":125.94,"text":"その日が来ないよう、わざと間違えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":127.47,"end":130.47,"text":"崩れ落ちた、乖離と解脱","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":130.86,"end":133.86,"text":"救いなどないよう、限りあるなんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":136.09,"end":139.09,"text":"まだ、想う熱","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":141.23,"end":144.23,"text":"愛情はhighただ捨て置くばかり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":145.79,"end":148.79,"text":"剥がれ落ちた大事な記憶","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":149.57999999999998,"end":152.57999999999998,"text":"But 後悔 low-lifeならば敢えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":153.77,"end":156.77,"text":"ありえないことを願う夏を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}